@startuml approachA-sequence
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title Calculate a holdings report
caption Current implementation on main
participant "Reporting service" as S
participant "Storage ports" as D
participant "Quote port" as Q
participant "Domain calculator" as C
S -> D: Load portfolio
D --> S: Portfolio (including remaining lots)
S -> D: Load transaction history
D --> S: All T transactions
S -> Q: Request holding tickers
note over Q
Sequential default lookup;
real adapters can serve cached quotes.
A provider failure propagates.
end note
Q --> S: Quote map
S -> C: Portfolio + history + quotes
activate C
C -> C: Accumulate historical totals
C -> C: Combine with remaining lots
note over C
O(T + K + L) approximate work
K historical tickers; L visited lots
end note
C --> S: List<HoldingPerformance>
deactivate C
note over S
The REST adapter maps domain
results to HoldingDTO.
end note
@enduml
